    "ZenbuJapaneseUITests/SearchExperienceJourneyUITests/testImageTextAppleTranslationWorksOfflineAcrossPhysicalColdRelaunch": "Apple Translation asset installation and airplane-mode cold relaunch require the separately recorded physical-device HIL journey; Apple documents that Translation does not operate in iOS Simulator.",
